From 82b414ade72057fc82423c456796569f53454c43 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: r7c <r7c@local>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:58:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] status.BUFF_PULSE_REDUCTION = client16402_twice: a buff's
 damage pulse takes its target's DamageReduction twice

Mechanic: state.rs buff_pulse_pass pushed a buff's own damage pulse (status.rs pulse_amount: Poison, Tornado, Earthquake,
the Goblin Curse) into the damage buffer whole, and Resolve reduced it once by the target's DamageReduction
(combat.rs damage_reduction_of: the Evo Knight's idle Knight_Fortify_EV1 60, the Monk's shield, the hero Valkyrie's 15),
so a Poison pulse on a fortified Evo Knight took 40 % (147 -> 58). New arm client16402_twice (shipped): buff_pulse_pass
reduces the pulse by the reduction on that tick before it enters the buffer, and Resolve reduces it again (147 -> 58 ->
23). Old arm once; CLIENT15535_ARMS keeps it (unread there), format-3 snapshots keep it. Damage that is not a buff's own
pulse (a projectile's, an area's strike) is untouched.

Minimal reproduction: tests/buff_pulse_reduction.rs: a blue Evo Knight (level 11) put down with nothing to fight and kept
on its point, a red Poison on it; its first pulse is 40 % of 40 % of a plain Knight's under the new arm and 40 % under
the old. Plant buff_pulse_reduced_once turns it red.

Parity-Evidence: ClashBot scratchpad/gauntlet/L74/parity/diag_night/r7c (poisoncen.py, dotsum.py) on the 499 captured
client 16.402 frame logs: a Poison pulse on an Evo Knight with its Knight_Fortify_EV1 row on took 21 / 23 (17 clean
pulses in 8 battles) where the same pulse took 133 / 147 off the Ice Wizards under the same cloud on the same frames
(133 -> 53 -> 21, 147 -> 58 -> 23) and 133 / 147 / 182 off an Evo Knight attacking (row off); a Tornado pulse 21 against
134 on the Ice Wizard beside it (20261017_185542 t2836); an Earthquake pulse 15. Hits that are not a buff's own pulse are
reduced once: the Mother Witch's curse shot 212 -> 84, the Blowdart poison area 93 -> 37 and 158 -> 63. Fixture
liveplay 20261018_045719 t4328 / t4348 / t4368: our walking Evo Knight takes 23 per Poison pulse, the engine 58.
